OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,FMore than 160 golfers have taken part
OL,7,Fin a charity golf day in memory of the
OL,8,Flate boxer, Ricky Hatton.
OL,10,FRicky's close friends and family led
OL,11,Fthe morning group of 20 teams around
OL,12,FRomiley Golf Club in the event which
OL,13,Faimed to raise up to #25,000 for
OL,14,Fgrassroot gyms and sports clubs. A
OL,15,Ffurther 20 teams competed in the
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,18,FRicky was found "unresponsive" at his
OL,19,Fhome in Hyde on 14 September 2025.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
