OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,FAs well as supporting the local
OL,7,Fsporting community, the golf day hopes
OL,8,Fto raise awareness for men's mental
OL,9,Fhealth with a portion of the money
OL,10,Falso going toward the Ricky Hatton
OL,11,FFoundation.
OL,13,FStephen Heaton, close friend of Ricky.
OL,15,FStephen Heaton, a close friend of
OL,16,FRicky said: "Men don't speak, and its
OL,17,Fabout time that we did.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
