OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,F"I don't play golf really, but we've
OL,7,Fall got together and made a good day
OL,8,Fin memory of Ricky. A bit of
OL,9,Fcamaraderie, its what you need with
OL,10,Fyour mates.
OL,12,F"You can just speak about your general
OL,13,Fhealth and wellbeing, what's going on
OL,14,Fin your life and if you've got any
OL,15,Fproblems, just speak about it."
OL,17,FCampbell Hatton, Ricky Hatton's son.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
