OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,FRicky's son Campbell Hatton, he said
OL,7,Fhe hopes the memorial event will be
OL,8,Fthe first of many: "Its been a great
OL,9,Fturn out, a lot of people involved, it
OL,10,Fwould be good if we could make it (an)
OL,11,Fannual thing and keep supporting the
OL,12,Flocal community"
OL,14,FAlthough a natural in the ring,
OL,15,FCampbell has only ever played golf
OL,16,Fonce before, on his performance he
OL,17,Fsaid: "I'll let the video speak for
OL,18,Fitself... nearly killed the cameraman
OL,19,Fwith one shot but pulled it back
OL,20,Fthere".
