OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,FThe event started out as just a few
OL,7,Fclose friends coming together, but as
OL,8,Fthe community rallied their support,
OL,9,Fit turned into a fundraiser where
OL,10,Fpeople could come together and share
OL,11,Fmemories of Ricky.
OL,13,FFormer Manchester United footballers
OL,14,FBrian McClair and Chris Eagles were
OL,15,Falso in attendance.
OL,17,FAndrew Walton is a local businessman
OL,18,Fand close friend of the Hatton family.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
