OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786342684
OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,FAndrew Walton, a close family friend
OL,7,Fof the Hatton's said "He'd of
OL,8,Fdefinitely been joining in, he'd have
OL,9,Fprobably been stood here not playing
OL,10,Fgolf with me, just wandering round the
OL,11,Fcourse, having a good laugh like we
OL,12,Fall had at the 10th tee.
OL,14,F"There will come a time where young
OL,15,Fpeople won't have heard of Ricky
OL,16,FHatton, we want to keep his legacy
OL,17,Falive.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
