OL,3,CRicky Hatton Memorial Golf Day raises
OL,4,Cmoney for grassroots sports clubs
OL,6,F"He was the biggest sports personality
OL,7,Fthats ever been produced by Hyde and
OL,8,Fthe area, everybody absolutely loved
OL,9,Fhim. He had time for everybody."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
